In the example usage, the function is called with the numbers 48 and 18. The function will first find the GCD of 18 and the remainder of 48 divided by 18 (which is 0), and then the GCD of 18 and 48 (which is 18). The function will continue this process until it reaches the GCD of 18 and 0, which is 18. The final result is then returned as 18.

